{"parse": {"title": "FW-07", "pageid": 25761, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FW-06\" title=\"FW-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FW-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/FW-08\" title=\"FW-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FW</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.AD.A7.E8.B7.AF.E6.97.A0.E5.A4.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"歧路无多\">歧路无多</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 歧路无多</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">No More Astray</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 1660307</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/70/HeadIconSmall-623701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>这幅光景，转眼就在我自己身上上演了啊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>也不知您当时是如何肯放心的，我现在便十分担忧，怕的是要受责备，又总紧张着您是头一回用人工梦游，要是将机器弄坏，我们全得关在里头……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你似是颇为喜爱手工制品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>嗯……？哦！您的话题可太难追上了，幸好我步子快。当然，我先前说的这些都是真心话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>你此前所提及之处，我已记下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您记得！那好，您若是打算飞去瞧瞧，回程时是否能帮我捎带些小东西……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我想，也许你看过这些，也能将其记住。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu3\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu3\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/11/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu3.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>我们生来通人言，能勘骨相。身形似人，亦近似飞鸟。一但身死，顷刻便化作白骨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>族群相信，活着便意味着尽可能地记录所见，将它们全部藏纳于骨骸之中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>而那些死去的族人，他们的骨头会被携往新的栖息地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>因战火蔓延，我们从边疆迁至中原。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>此处风光与过往不同，族人们不断下山，回到山中的只有越来越多的骸骨，以及各异的传言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>山下人称我们为灭蒙鸟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>但我们更愿意取用一个姓氏，来指代整个族群：葛天。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getianhuaishu1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getianhuaishu1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">燕平：</div><div>——而我是第一只诞生在中原的葛天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>山风扑面，比冻土之上夹杂着雪粒的寒风要柔和，拂动鸟儿的羽毛与驻足者的发丝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而林野中的声音似乎又是相近的，兽类的脚爪在土壤和枝条上轻轻放落，流水淌过石块的间隙，响动细微绵延。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>在相当久的一段时间里，我只是栖在这棵槐树上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>不再有族人偶尔前来与我搭话，他们大多都彻底停下，成为了祠堂中的骨头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>骨头总是诚实的。有些吵闹，有些始终不发一言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>下山实在无趣，在山中又无事可做。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>不知是哪一日，我忽而想到，山下人无法阅读骨相，但也有自己的方式，记取所历所感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>书画，诗文，乐律，雕刻，乃至许多其他事物……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>——我掌握了一切与此相关的技艺，也读过了几乎每位族人的生平。我可以做出尝试。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您打算带我去看什么？一间藏满珍宝的展室么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>一间仅有死物的房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>请进。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getiancitang1\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getiancitang1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>我的骨杖，用材取自一位族人。下山之前，他曾对我多加照拂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>我不曾在祠堂中见到他的骨头，本以为他仍旧活着。直到无意中借其他骨骸所说的话语，找到了他所在的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>原来那座庙宇就在不远的城郊，早已破败不堪……他不为后世香火，亦不为回归族群。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>我不明白。不过，这也是他的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>所以，我并未将他带回祠堂。但这些卷轴之中，仍有着关于他的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>这间屋子不算大，但要从中寻出特定的记录，应该是件麻烦事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻人费力地借助昏暗的光线辨别那些收藏的轮廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>悬挂的纸张，铺散的纸张，掩藏在纸张之下的雕刻与缺少光泽的骨骼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>……您要如何找出所说的那卷故事呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>不必找。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_at_getiancitang2\"><img alt=\"1_6_at_getiancitang2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png/600px-Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png/900px-Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_at_getiancitang2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸟儿偏过头，室内骤然亮起的灯火带来一片黄昏颜色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>“腐骨一矣，孰知其异？且趣当生，奚遑死后？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这段话语虽然措辞陌生，年轻人却能领会其中的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看来葛天有意维持着用于沟通的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4c/HeadIconSmall-623711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>的确，无论生前是何种模样，死后也都只是一堆骨头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他环顾四周，并由衷地抽了口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>您的收藏……以及作品，真是令人惊叹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623712.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623712.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-623712.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623712.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">列昂尼德：</div><div>即使与那些声名颇盛的工匠相比，您也会是其中格外出色的一位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-308401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>这样么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-308410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">葛天：</div><div>多谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不是需要过多言语的时机。向已消逝的昨日之物吐露任何词句，最终都只是掷向空洞。于是唯有静默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这份寂静之中，年轻人听见羽毛拂过卷轴纸面的声响。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FW-07"}}